#: ../../source/administration-guide/compliance-with-mattermost.rst:2
msgid "Compliance with Mattermost"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/compliance-with-mattermost.rst:4
msgid ""
"Mattermost is purpose-built to help enterprises keep sensitive data safe "
"and compliant in the strictest, most complex environments. Mattermost "
"Enterprise Edition includes features designed to make compliance with all"
" relevant regulations and internal policies easy to achieve and maintain."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/compliance-with-mattermost.rst:19
msgid ""
":doc:`Compliance exports </administration-guide/comply/compliance-"
"export>` - Export compliance reports to third-party systems to archive "
"history."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/compliance-with-mattermost.rst:20
msgid ""
":doc:`Compliance monitoring </administration-guide/comply/compliance-"
"monitoring>` - Enable oversight and prevent unauthorized queries with "
"compliance exports."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/compliance-with-mattermost.rst:21
msgid ""
":doc:`Electronic discovery </administration-guide/comply/electronic-"
"discovery>` - Extract data from Mattermost for eDiscovery."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/compliance-with-mattermost.rst:22
msgid ""
":doc:`Data retention </administration-guide/comply/data-retention-"
"policy>` - Control how long data is stored in Mattermost with global and "
"custom retention policies to meet data retention compliance requirements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/compliance-with-mattermost.rst:23
msgid ""
":doc:`Export channel data </administration-guide/comply/export-"
"mattermost-channel-data>` - Migrate data between systems and back data up"
" for operational continuity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/compliance-with-mattermost.rst:24
msgid ""
":doc:`Legal Hold </administration-guide/comply/legal-hold>` - Preserve "
"relevant Mattermost information when litigation is anticipated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/compliance-with-mattermost.rst:25
msgid ""
":doc:`JSON audit log schema </administration-guide/comply/embedded-json-"
"audit-log-schema>` - Learn how to configure Mattermost audit logging "
"using a JSON object."
msgstr ""

